@startuml Flujo de Autenticación JWT
title Diagrama de Secuencia - Autenticación y Autorización UDIPSAI

actor "Usuario\n(Especialista/Pasante)" as User
participant "Frontend\n(React SPA)" as Front
participant "API Gateway\n(Nginx)" as Nginx
participant "JwtAuthFilter" as Filter
participant "AuthController\n/api/auth" as AuthCtrl
participant "JwtTokenProvider" as JwtProv
participant "RefreshTokenService" as RefServ
participant "CustomUserDetails" as UserDet
participant "Spring Security\nContext" as SecCtx
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== 1. Inicio de Sesión (Login) ==
User -> Front : Ingresa cédula + contraseña
Front -> Nginx : POST /api/auth/login\n{username, password}
Nginx -> Filter : Intercepta petición
Filter -> Filter : Ruta /api/auth/** es pública\n(permitAll) - No requiere token
Filter -> AuthCtrl : Deja pasar

AuthCtrl -> AuthCtrl : authenticationManager.authenticate()
activate AuthCtrl
AuthCtrl -> UserDet : loadUserByUsername(cedula)
UserDet -> DB : Busca en especialistas o pasantes\npor cédula
DB --> UserDet : Especialista/Pasante encontrado
UserDet -> UserDet : Carga permisos desde Permisos entity\nConvierte a SimpleGrantedAuthority
UserDet --> AuthCtrl : UserPrincipal (con autoridades)
AuthCtrl -> AuthCtrl : Verifica contraseña con BCrypt
AuthCtrl -> JwtProv : generateToken(authentication)
JwtProv -> JwtProv : Construye JWT con:\n- subject: cedula\n- authorities: [PERM_*, ROLE_*]\n- name: nombresApellidos\n- exp: now + jwt.expiration\n- firma: HMAC-SHA512
JwtProv --> AuthCtrl : accessToken (JWT)

AuthCtrl -> RefServ : createRefreshToken(cedula)
RefServ -> DB : INSERT INTO refreshtoken\n(token=UUID, username, expiryDate)
DB --> RefServ : OK
RefServ --> AuthCtrl : refreshToken

AuthCtrl --> Front : JwtResponse {\n  accessToken, tokenType="Bearer",\n  refreshToken, username, roles\n}
deactivate AuthCtrl

Front -> Front : localStorage.setItem("accessToken")\nlocalStorage.setItem("refreshToken")\njwtDecode(token) -> extrae permisos y roles
Front --> User : Dashboard (autenticado)

== 2. Petición Autenticada ==
User -> Front : Navega a /pacientes
Front -> Nginx : GET /api/pacientes/activos\nAuthorization: Bearer <accessToken>
Nginx -> Filter : Intercepta

Filter -> Filter : Extrae "Bearer <token>" del header
Filter -> JwtProv : validateToken(token)
JwtProv -> JwtProv : Verifica firma HMAC-SHA512\nVerifica expiración
JwtProv --> Filter : token válido

Filter -> JwtProv : getUsernameFromJWT(token)
JwtProv --> Filter : cedula
Filter -> UserDet : loadUserByUsername(cedula)
UserDet --> Filter : UserDetails (con autoridades)
Filter -> SecCtx : SecurityContextHolder.setAuthentication()
SecCtx --> Filter : OK
Filter -> Filter : Continua cadena de filtros

Filter -> "PacienteController\n/api/pacientes" : @PreAuthorize("PERM_PACIENTES")
"PacienteController\n/api/pacientes" -> "PacienteController\n/api/pacientes" : Verifica autoridad en SecurityContext

== 3. Token Expirado - Refresh ==
note over Front,DB : Cuando el accessToken expira (HTTP 401)

User -> Front : Acción que requiere API
Front -> Nginx : GET /api/pacientes\nAuthorization: Bearer <token_expirado>
Nginx -> Filter : Intercepta
Filter -> JwtProv : validateToken(token)
JwtProv --> Filter : FALSE (expiró)
Filter -> Filter : No establece SecurityContext
Filter -> "PacienteController\n/api/pacientes" : Continua (sin auth)
"PacienteController\n/api/pacientes" -> "PacienteController\n/api/pacientes" : @PreAuthorize -> DENEGADO
"PacienteController\n/api/pacientes" --> Front : HTTP 401 Unauthorized

Front -> Front : Interceptor Axios detecta 401\nNo es login ni refresh\nNo está en cola de espera
Front -> Front : Encola petición fallida
Front -> Nginx : POST /api/auth/refresh\n{refreshToken}
Nginx -> AuthCtrl : refresh()
AuthCtrl -> RefServ : findByToken(refreshToken)
RefServ -> DB : SELECT * FROM refreshtoken
DB --> RefServ : encontrado
AuthCtrl -> RefServ : verifyExpiration(token)
RefServ --> AuthCtrl : OK (no expiró)
AuthCtrl -> UserDet : loadUserByUsername(username)
UserDet --> AuthCtrl : UserDetails
AuthCtrl -> JwtProv : generateToken(new Auth)
JwtProv --> AuthCtrl : nuevo accessToken
AuthCtrl -> RefServ : deleteByUsername + createRefreshToken
RefServ -> DB : DELETE old + INSERT new refresh
DB --> RefServ : OK
AuthCtrl --> Front : TokenRefreshResponse {\n  accessToken, refreshToken\n}

Front -> Front : Almacena nuevos tokens\nDesencola y reenvía peticiones pendientes
Front --> User : Datos cargados

== 4. Cierre de Sesión ==
User -> Front : Click en "Cerrar Sesión"
Front -> Front : localStorage.removeItem("accessToken")\nlocalStorage.removeItem("refreshToken")\nlocalStorage.removeItem("tokenType")
Front -> User : Redirige a /signin

@enduml
